[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   TEP-9 step 058 -- comet observational-leverage audit
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   The transit signature (steps 030-041) rests on the three-leg orbit
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   reconstruction discrepancy d_of being larger for comets whose original
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   aphelia fall inside the boundary cap.  The dangerous confound is
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   observational leverage: if in-cap comets happened to be worse
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   observed -- fewer observations, shorter arcs, or arcs concentrated on
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   one side of perihelion -- a standard orbit fit would reconstruct them
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   worse regardless of any boundary, manufacturing a directional signal
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   from nothing.
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   This step measures the observing circumstances directly, on both
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   catalogues:
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   CODE (class-1 matched sample, N=54):
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   - nobs, arc length, perihelion year, q, i in-cap vs out-cap
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   - arc_frac = (T_peri - arc_start)/(arc_end - arc_start):
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   the fraction of the observed arc lying BEFORE perihelion.
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   frac ~ 0 or 1 means a one-sided arc (maximal leverage);
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   ~0.5 means symmetric data around perihelion.
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   - d_of retested on the balanced-arc subset (0.15<frac<0.85)
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   - regression control: d_of residualized on (nobs, arc, arc_frac),
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   then re-tested against the axis
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   - matched-pairs control on (nobs, arc, q)
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   Warsaw (spike sample, N=99):
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   - tablea1 supplies datat (pre/post/full arc symmetry), Nobs,
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   arc years, RMS, Nres, and the heliocentric distances of the
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   first/last observations (dh1/dh2)
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   - datat composition in-cap vs out-cap; the orbit-quality and
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   residual channels audited the same way
[2026-09-21 14:37:06 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 058]   Outputs: results/step_b23_comet_obs_audit.json,
